// Editor test (Script Test project): script components (API v20). A Spinner (C#: a Falcon.Component with
// [Property] members, registered by the source generator) added to an entity in the Inspector, its
// properties set (an Entity by name, an enum, a string), removed and brought back by undo, saved in a
// prefab; Play makes it (and the spawned prefab's: OnAwake, OnStart, OnFixedUpdate, OnUpdate); a hot
// reload while playing keeps its properties (and the game's OnStart, run again, spawns another);
// Stop puts the scene back.
[
